# Build output. The xtask shares the workspace target; each fuzz crate is its
# own workspace and ignores its own target in its own .gitignore.
/target

# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored. Committing it for a library does not
# affect how downstream crates resolve their dependencies, and it makes CI runs
# reproducible. The fuzz crates' lock files are ignored beside them.

# Registry tokens never belong in the tree, even if cargo is pointed here.
.cargo/credentials
.cargo/credentials.toml

# Property-test regressions are sources: proptest writes a failing seed there so
# the case is replayed on every run. Keep them.

# Coverage, profiling and mutation-testing output
*.profraw
*.profdata
/lcov.info
/coverage/
/tarpaulin-report.*
/perf.data*
/flamegraph.svg
/mutants.out*/

# Python helpers in ci/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Tool leftovers
*.rs.bk
*.orig
*.rej
*.bundle

/docs/

# Local environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
.envrc
.direnv/

# AI assistants: local settings, memory and session files
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.mcp.json

# Editors
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.zed/
.fleet/
.helix/
*.swp
*.swo
.*.sw?
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# Operating system clutter
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
